{"id":"old-iranian-1349043","title":"Reza, the Motorcyclist","imdbCode":"old-iranian-1349043","imdbUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0318028/","source":"old-iranian-archive","sourceName":"Old Iranian Film Archive","sourcePageUrl":"https://oldfarsi.blogspot.com/search/label/%D8%B1%D8%B6%D8%A7%D9%85%D9%88%D8%AA%D9%88%D8%B1%DB%8C","sourceUrls":["https://oldfarsi.blogspot.com/search/label/%D8%B1%D8%B6%D8%A7%D9%85%D9%88%D8%AA%D9%88%D8%B1%DB%8C","https://oldfarsi.blogspot.com/search?q=%D8%B1%D8%B6%D8%A7%D9%85%D9%88%D8%AA%D9%88%D8%B1%DB%8C"],"type":"movie","year":1970,"persianYear":1349,"releaseDate":"1970-01-01","originalTitle":"Reza motori","imdbVotes":1304,"imdbRating":6.6,"groups":["Old Iranian Films"],"qualities":[],"links":[],"genres":["Crime","Drama"],"persianGenres":["فیلم درام","فیلم جنایی"],"countries":["Iran"],"persianCountries":["ایران"],"languages":["Persian"],"persianLanguages":["فارسی"],"overview":"Reza Motori, who has feigned madness, escapes from an asylum and robs a factory, with the aid of a friend. Afterwards, a young writer, who looks exactly like Reza, visits the asylum in order to write about inmates. There he is mistaken for Reza and detained. Meanwhile, Reza assumes the identity of the writer. Reza falls in love with the writer's fiancée and decides to give up the money he has stolen from the factory, but his friends prevent him from doing so. Ultimately, Reza is killed when he collides with a truck on his way to meet his beloved. Received the best actor and best music prizes at the Third Iranian National Film Festival \"Sepas\" in 1971.","persianOverview":null,"tagline":null,"runtimeMinutes":87,"posterUrl":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTIzMmE4NWEtZDNkNy00NTQ4LWIwMTEtMDk0YzY4ZTA5NWMyXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/%D8%B1%D8%B6%D8%A7_%D9%85%D9%88%D8%AA%D9%88%D8%B1%DB%8C_1_(%D9%BE%D9%88%D8%B3%D8%AA%D8%B1).jpg/960px-%D8%B1%D8%B6%D8%A7_%D9%85%D9%88%D8%AA%D9%88%D8%B1%DB%8C_1_(%